#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:5
msgid "class LED -- portable on-board LED control"
msgstr "class LED -- kontrol LED on-board yang portabel"

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`LED` class is a thin portable wrapper around "
":class:`machine.Pin` that drives a named board LED, hiding the active-low / "
"active-high wiring difference between boards. It is shipped as a frozen "
"Python module by the OpenMV firmware (see ``scripts/libraries/machine.py``) "
"and is therefore available on every OpenMV-supported board, regardless of "
"port."
msgstr ""
"Kelas :class:`LED` adalah pembungkus portabel tipis di sekitar "
":class:`machine.Pin` yang mengendalikan LED board bernama, menyembunyikan "
"perbedaan pengkabelan aktif-rendah / aktif-tinggi antar board. Kelas ini "
"dikirimkan sebagai modul Python beku oleh firmware OpenMV (lihat "
"``scripts/libraries/machine.py``\\ ) dan oleh karena itu tersedia di setiap "
"board yang didukung OpenMV, terlepas dari port."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:14
msgid ""
"The LED is driven as a simple on/off GPIO; there is no PWM intensity "
"control. For LEDs wired to PWM-capable pins drive them via :class:`PWM` "
"directly instead."
msgstr ""
"LED dikendalikan sebagai GPIO on/off sederhana; tidak ada kontrol intensitas"
" PWM. Untuk LED yang dikabelkan ke pin berkemampuan PWM, kendalikan langsung"
" melalui :class:`PWM`\\ ."

